# PostgreSQL

- Relational columns for users, sessions, agents, evidence, events, signals.
- JSONB only for adapter extras, capabilities, and redacted traces.
- Migrations are SQL files in git. No `drizzle-kit push` against Compose data.
- Unique indexes enforce scan, signal, and notification idempotency.
